#
# Fail-witness for the no-duplicate ban on LEARNING (charter Hard Rule 10,
# ex:saNoRemintLearningTerms): a fixture that RE-MINTS gmeow:LearningEvent as rdfs:isDefinedBy the
# preference slice — the AC7 no-duplication violation (Principle 16). gmeow:PreferenceLearningEvent
# specializes gmeow:LearningEvent BY REFERENCE, but the parent term is never redeclared here.
# Unioned with the module by the gmeow:saFailWitness teeth check, it makes the ∃-redeclared-term
# ASK HOLD, proving the mustNot ban has teeth. The module must never carry this triple.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

gmeow:LearningEvent rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/preference> .
